# The pullback reclaim: weakness first, then price crosses back
# up through the 9-period EMA. The cross is an event, not a state —
# the previous close was at or below the line, this one is above it.

strategy "EMA Pullback Reclaim"

universe $NVDA
timeframe 1d

when [down_days 2] then within 3 bars price crosses above [ema 9]
  buy [5% portfolio]

sell when price crosses below [ema 9]
  or [stop 4%]
  or [after 15 bars]
